# Project instructions

When `.agents/instructions/` exists in this repository:

1. Open `.agents/instructions/INDEX.md` (if present) to see which topic files apply.
2. Read every instruction file whose **Audience** includes your agent role (or “all agents”).
3. Treat those rules as **project overrides** on top of your catalog agent persona and pack
   overlays — do not ignore them for convenience.
4. If instructions conflict with the catalog agent, prefer the instruction for
   repo-specific behaviour; escalate conflicts that break pipeline gates to the coordinator.

Instructions are maintained by `/agent-reconcile` (skill:
`.agents/skills/agent-reconcile/SKILL.md`) when custom agents are mapped or team conventions
are captured. Do not invent a parallel instructions tree under host folders (`.cursor/`,
`.claude/`) — edit only under `.agents/instructions/`.
